      "message": "docs: Sync with new fault proofs, add tutorials, grow facts check\n\n- Document the non-existent-input fraud-proof family (prepare command,\n  four submit steps, fourth --fraud-category) across the fault-proofs pages\n- Add DA committee node required configuration to the libp2p runtime page\n- Add getting-the-code prerequisites and two tutorials: run a local stack,\n  submit a first L2 transaction\n- Lead validation and node overviews with the reader's task\n- Extend check-docs-facts.mjs from 3 to 6 derived facts: node CLI commands,\n  workspace members, L1 env variables\n- Drop the removed L1_PROVIDER_FAILOVER reference and one leftover\n  source-citation phrase\n- Move pnpm overrides to pnpm-workspace.yaml (pnpm 10 stopped reading\n  package.json overrides), drop unused tailwind-merge and lib/cn.ts",
      "authorName": "Harun Mwangi",
      "authorDate": "2026-07-10T13:15:40Z"
    },
