      "message": "docs: Check documented facts against source\n\n- Add check-docs-facts.mjs, run by prebuild and CI: fibers, fault-proof\n  commands, and transaction statuses must match their source\n- Drop the status page feature matrix; public_testnet_readiness.md owns it\n- Replace the DA blueprint commit pin with an aiken build step",
