      "message": "docs: Add Midgard documentation site\n\nFumadocs/Next.js site covering the SDK packages, validation engine, operator\nnode, watchers and DA, fault proofs, on-chain validators, and the spec.\n\n- Type-check SDK code samples with twoslash; `prebuild` builds the linked\n  packages the samples resolve against\n- Add docs-site-ci.yml\n- Anchor the root `docs/` ignore rule, which also matched\n  docs-site/content/docs and docs-site/app/docs\n- Document \"No mints\" as an open protocol question, tracked in #459",
